   "text": "content store   -   object storage, NOT a table\n  bodies:      content_hash -> body bytes\n  attachments: content_hash -> attachment bytes\n  immutable, reference-counted",
   "originalText": "content store   -   object storage, NOT a table\n  bodies:      content_hash -> body bytes\n  attachments: content_hash -> attachment bytes\n  immutable, reference-counted",
