  {
   "id": "cl2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 1018,
   "width": 699,
   "height": 21,
   "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100104,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700728,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Why the partition key is (user_id, folder_id) and not just user_id",
   "originalText": "Why the partition key is (user_id, folder_id) and not just user_id",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "q",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 1056,
   "width": 820,
   "height": 90,
   "strokeColor": "#1e293b",
   "backgroundColor": "#1e293b",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100105,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700735,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": [
    {
     "id": "q_t",
     "type": "text"
    }
   ],
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "q_t",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 38,
   "y": 1078,
   "width": 804,
   "height": 45,
   "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100106,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700742,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "SELECT * FROM messages_by_folder\n WHERE user_id = ? AND folder_id = ?\n ORDER BY message_uuid DESC LIMIT 50;      -- ONE partition, ONE range scan",
   "originalText": "SELECT * FROM messages_by_folder\n WHERE user_id = ? AND folder_id = ?\n ORDER BY message_uuid DESC LIMIT 50;      -- ONE partition, ONE range scan",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "q",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "cn",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 880,
   "y": 1056,
   "width": 599,
   "height": 75,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100107,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700749,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "With user_id alone, all of one user's mail is ONE partition. For a mailbox with\ntwo million messages that partition is enormous - and in a wide-column store the\npartition is the unit of storage AND of repair, so unbounded growth is an\noperational problem before it is a storage one. Adding folder_id bounds it and,\nmore importantly, matches the dominant query exactly.",
   "originalText": "With user_id alone, all of one user's mail is ONE partition. For a mailbox with\ntwo million messages that partition is enormous - and in a wide-column store the\npartition is the unit of storage AND of repair, so unbounded growth is an\noperational problem before it is a storage one. Adding folder_id bounds it and,\nmore importantly, matches the dominant query exactly.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "cost",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 1176,
   "width": 820,
   "height": 44,
   "strokeColor": "#b45309",
   "backgroundColor": "#fef3c7",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100108,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700756,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": [
    {
     "id": "cost_t",
     "type": "text"
    }
   ],
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "cost_t",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 38,
   "y": 1190,
   "width": 804,
   "height": 16,
   "strokeColor": "#374151",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100109,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700763,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "the cost:  moving a message between folders is a DELETE plus an INSERT",
   "originalText": "the cost:  moving a message between folders is a DELETE plus an INSERT",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "cost",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "cn2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 1236,
   "width": 1011,
   "height": 65,
   "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100110,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700770,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Because the folder is part of the partition key, a different folder is a different partition. A genuine cost, and acceptable\nfor two reasons: listing a folder is vastly more frequent than moving a message, and the row being moved is ~500 bytes rather\nthan 50 KB - THE BODY DOES NOT MOVE, ONLY THE POINTER DOES. Which is where separating content from state pays off a second\ntime, in an unexpected place.",
   "originalText": "Because the folder is part of the partition key, a different folder is a different partition. A genuine cost, and acceptable\nfor two reasons: listing a folder is vastly more frequent than moving a message, and the row being moved is ~500 bytes rather\nthan 50 KB - THE BODY DOES NOT MOVE, ONLY THE POINTER DOES. Which is where separating content from state pays off a second\ntime, in an unexpected place.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
