  {
   "id": "dl",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 1348,
   "width": 446,
   "height": 21,
   "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100112,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700784,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Why read/unread needs a whole second table",
   "originalText": "Why read/unread needs a whole second table",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "un",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 1386,
   "width": 820,
   "height": 110,
   "strokeColor": "#1e293b",
   "backgroundColor": "#1e293b",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100113,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700791,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": [
    {
     "id": "un_t",
     "type": "text"
    }
   ],
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "un_t",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 38,
   "y": 1411,
   "width": 804,
   "height": 60,
   "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100114,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700798,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "mail arrives       ->  INSERT into messages_by_folder AND unread_by_folder\nuser marks read    ->  UPDATE is_read in messages_by_folder\n                       DELETE from unread_by_folder   <- the row simply leaves\nuser marks unread  ->  re-INSERT into unread_by_folder",
   "originalText": "mail arrives       ->  INSERT into messages_by_folder AND unread_by_folder\nuser marks read    ->  UPDATE is_read in messages_by_folder\n                       DELETE from unread_by_folder   <- the row simply leaves\nuser marks unread  ->  re-INSERT into unread_by_folder",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "un",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "dn",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 880,
   "y": 1386,
   "width": 584,
   "height": 75,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100115,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700805,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Cassandra-family stores cannot efficiently filter on a non-key column, so\nWHERE is_read = false would mean fetching the whole folder and filtering in\nmemory. Fine for 50 messages, unusable for a mailbox with a million. So the\ntrade is explicit: DUPLICATED STORAGE AND A WRITE-TIME CONSISTENCY OBLIGATION,\nin exchange for a query that would otherwise be impossible.",
   "originalText": "Cassandra-family stores cannot efficiently filter on a non-key column, so\nWHERE is_read = false would mean fetching the whole folder and filtering in\nmemory. Fine for 50 messages, unusable for a mailbox with a million. So the\ntrade is explicit: DUPLICATED STORAGE AND A WRITE-TIME CONSISTENCY OBLIGATION,\nin exchange for a query that would otherwise be impossible.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "dn2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 880,
   "y": 1478,
   "width": 584,
   "height": 75,
   "strokeColor": "#b45309",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100116,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700812,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The honest risk is drift: a partial failure leaves a row in unread_by_folder\nthat messages_by_folder says is read. That presents as a WRONG UNREAD BADGE -\nconfusing rather than harmful - and it is why the unread count is periodically\nrecomputed rather than trusted indefinitely. Naming it as a known drift with a\nknown repair beats pretending the denormalization is free.",
   "originalText": "The honest risk is drift: a partial failure leaves a row in unread_by_folder\nthat messages_by_folder says is read. That presents as a WRONG UNREAD BADGE -\nconfusing rather than harmful - and it is why the unread count is periodically\nrecomputed rather than trusted indefinitely. Naming it as a known drift with a\nknown repair beats pretending the denormalization is free.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
