   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "pn_1000",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1026,
   "y": 1634,
   "width": 342,
   "height": 16,
   "strokeColor": "#047857",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100126,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700882,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "marking read touches ~500 bytes, not 50 KB",
   "originalText": "marking read touches ~500 bytes, not 50 KB",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "pd_1000",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1026,
   "y": 1660,
   "width": 368,
   "height": 30,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100127,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700889,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "because the mutable row and the immutable content\nare separate objects.",
   "originalText": "because the mutable row and the immutable content\nare separate objects.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "en",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 1736,
   "width": 1011,
   "height": 81,
   "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100128,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700896,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The cost is REFERENCE COUNTING, and it is the part that needs care. Content can only be reclaimed when the last recipient\ndeletes their copy, so either maintain a refcount (correct, and a hot contended row for a widely-forwarded attachment) or run\na periodic mark-and-sweep collector (cheaper, and reclaims late). The GC approach is the right default here for the same\nreason the object-storage case study takes it: ORPHANED BYTES ARE CHEAP, AND A DANGLING POINTER IS DATA LOSS. Delete the\nmetadata row immediately; reclaim the content later.",
   "originalText": "The cost is REFERENCE COUNTING, and it is the part that needs care. Content can only be reclaimed when the last recipient\ndeletes their copy, so either maintain a refcount (correct, and a hot contended row for a widely-forwarded attachment) or run\na periodic mark-and-sweep collector (cheaper, and reclaims late). The GC approach is the right default here for the same\nreason the object-storage case study takes it: ORPHANED BYTES ARE CHEAP, AND A DANGLING POINTER IS DATA LOSS. Delete the\nmetadata row immediately; reclaim the content later.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d6",
   "type": "line",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 1846,
   "width": 1680,
   "height": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#cbd5e1",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
